# Packages added to the live image's package list, one per line (# starts a comment).
#
# The brand and identity overlay needs none: it only adds files, pacman hooks and configuration for what the upstream
# list already installs. Build-time tools that render the artwork (librsvg, imagemagick, plymouth) belong to
# ../render-deps.txt, the build container, not to the image.
#
# Other parts of the overlay (the installer) may append their own lines below.

# kdialog: calamares-online.sh reports failures from a desktop icon, which has no terminal. The live image has libnotify but
# neither kdialog nor zenity (checked in the built demo ISO's pacman database).
kdialog
